stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    %% ============================================================
    %% Learner Sub-State FSM (trivial)
    %% ============================================================
    %% Learner is a passive observer — accumulates decided assertions.
    %% No Inactive state. No protocol-driving logic.
    %% ============================================================

    [*] --> Learned_empty : Learned []

    Learned_empty --> Learned_values : Decided msg received
    Learned_values --> Learned_values : additional Decided msgs

    note right of Learned_values
        Accumulates assertion list.
        No Inactive state — learners are
        passive and don't need recovery.
    end note
